    "taxonId": 320739,
    "summary": "A tree fern native to Madagascar and widely distributed across sub-Saharan Africa. It usually has a stout trunk, dense crown and large arching fronds, and often grows in open, moist places such as grasslands and stream banks.",
    "humanEdibility": "unknown",
    "edibilityNote": null,
